message: "If you use this software in academic work, please cite it as below."
title: "Daily Arxiv in My Domain"
abstract: >-
  A domain-aware daily arXiv scout. A deterministic screen driven by an explicit research map
  (areas, sub-areas and lineage anchors) selects candidates for a batched LLM jury, which scores
  relevance, credibility and novelty; a portfolio allocator then applies area quotas and quality
  floors to produce a 10-15 paper daily digest with per-paper reading notes. Reader feedback is
  compiled into a versioned, human-editable selection strategy that re-weights the next run.
type: software
